# Data & API Rules

- Domain logic lives in modules, not in route handlers or components.
- Mutations use Server Actions or Route Handlers.
- All public POST endpoints must be rate-limited.
- Webhooks must verify signatures and be idempotent.
- Prisma queries for customer/admin data must be scoped by customerId / locationId + role.
- Use optimistic locking or version fields on concurrent edits (estimates, ROs).
- Write audit log entries for significant staff actions.
- Availability / slot queries must never be statically cached.
